3	Wyrld	3	2023-01-28 23:50:35.234045+00	138046020	<div>In a wyrld of floating islands, mechanical skyships and ancient magical mysteries, heroic adventurers take to the skies as the Iman Empire and Hygar Republic teeter on the brink of war. \n\n<u>Curent Missions</u>\n1. <b>Plot against the Hanseltons.</b> Somebody attempted to blow up a meeting between Hanselton and Sul families\n2. <b>Kahn Cometh. </b>A dark warrior has been dispatched to slay the party if the damage to the ethereal realm is not mended\n3. <b>Visiting the Collage</b>. Seek answers to personal magical mysteries as the Mages College, Talon's point.\n\n<u>Our Heros:\n</u>Vandolain (vandolina) - Tiefling Rogue \nKhazier - Elf Monk\nAyla - Elf Druid\nSteffi - Harengon Bard\nBrock Blackstar - Dwarf Sorcerer\nLex Lionheart - lionen warlock\nVoxre Rarc - Tuscan Barbarian\nTherefin Olara - Half Elf Paladin\nSans Sherrif - Saurian Trailblazer</div>	91	t
