33	Lower City - Iron Districts	t	8	3	The poor, lower city far bellow the main streets of the Iron District.\n<div><div>Construction in the iron districts began at ground level and expanded quickly upwards. Many layers of criss crossed roads, bridges and tightly wound streets quickly blocked sunlight from reaching the groud. Debris and refuse started piling up and while much of it was carted off to badbellow the undercity still became an undesireable destination. \n\n<div><div><div>Smaller communities now dot the lower city, some ranchers took advantage of the wide abandoned swaths to raise the horses favored throughout the city for transportation.\n\n\n</div><br></div><br></div></div><br></div>	City	\N
41	Mycelae	t	91	30	<div>Mycelae is a planetary cluster system that revolves around a single star, known as the "Cragstar". The Mycelae cluster is home to several planets and moons which are interconnected through a webbing of unknown galactic energy fields. There are about seven known planets which inhabit this cluster and may contain life.<br></div>	Realm	\N
