59	Shadowplane	The Darkstars are trapped in a realm known as the Shadowplane. The Shadowplane is a parallel dimension that exists alongside Mara Cuora but is shrouded in darkness and infused with negative energy. It is a realm of shadows, where the laws of reality are distorted and corrupted.\n\nWithin the Shadowplane, the Darkstars are imprisoned, cut off from the rest of Mara Cuora. The realm serves as a prison, sealing away their malevolent power and preventing them from wreaking havoc on the planet. The Shadowplane acts as a barrier between the Darkstars and the natural energy meridians that serve as portals to other realms, including Mara Cuora.\n\nWhile trapped in the Shadowplane, the Darkstars plot and scheme, seeking a way to break free from their prison and return to Mara Cuora. They are drawn to the powerful natural energy meridians, as these locations offer the potential for accessing other realms and bypassing the barriers that confine them. Their ultimate goal is to break through the barriers, reach Mara Cuora, and unleash the dark energy they possess, spreading chaos and corruption across the land.\n\nThe Shadowplane serves as both a prison and a testing ground for the Darkstars. It is a realm of constant darkness and twisted manifestations, where they must navigate treacherous landscapes and face the shadows that dwell within. The realm itself reflects their dark nature, and the longer they remain trapped, the stronger their desire to escape and fulfill their malevolent ambitions.	\N	2023-05-25 19:14:35.511327+00	30	\N	\N	2	19
