72	secret	It is a powerful artifact associated with the god Celios, the deity of death, kingdoms, fortune, destiny, power, fate, and time. The tome is said to contain ancient and sacred knowledge, granting the reader insight into the mysteries of the universe and the ability to manipulate aspects of fate and time.\n\nThe Tome of Celios is said to be a large, leather-bound book with intricate engravings on its cover. Its pages are made of a mysterious material that seems to shimmer with a faint golden glow. The text within the tome is written in a language unknown to most, requiring special knowledge or magical abilities to decipher.\n\nLegend has it that the tome holds the secrets of past, present, and future events, allowing those who possess it to glimpse possible futures and make subtle changes to the course of history. It is also believed to grant the reader glimpses into the realm of the dead, enabling communication with spirits and the manipulation of souls.\n\nThe Tome of Celios is highly sought after by scholars, mages, and those who seek power and control over the forces of fate and time. Its existence is often the subject of myths and legends, and its true location and current possessor are usually shrouded in secrecy. Many believe that the tome has the ability to shape the destiny of nations and individuals, making it a coveted artifact with potentially world-altering consequences.	\N	2023-06-18 17:42:44.786162+00	30	\N	18	2	\N
70	Encounter	Astral Shadow Stalker:\n\nLOOT: Shadow Mist (creates a shadowy mist around itself 10ft radius, all creatures are blind within that area)\n\nLarge Celestial Aberration, Chaotic Evil\n\nArmor Class: 16 (natural armor)\nHit Points: 150 (15d10 + 75)\nSpeed: 40 ft., fly 60 ft.\n\nSTR: 18 (+4)\nDEX: 16 (+3)\nCON: 20 (+5)\nINT: 14 (+2)\nWIS: 12 (+1)\nCHA: 16 (+3)\n\nSaving Throws: DEX +6, CON +9, WIS +4\nSkills: Perception +4, Stealth +6\nDamage Resistances: Necrotic, Psychic\nDamage Immunities: Force, Radiant\nCondition Immunities: Charmed, Frightened, Petrified\nSenses: Darkvision 120 ft., passive Perception 14\nLanguages: Understands Common, Celestial, Sylvan, and Abyssal but can't speak\n\nShadow Shift: As a bonus action, the Astral Shadowstalker can shift into the ethereal plane until the start of its next turn.\n\nUmbral Veil: While in dim light or darkness, the Astral Shadowstalker is invisible.\n\nActions:\n\nMultiattack: The Astral Shadowstalker makes three attacks: two with its Shadowy Claws and one with its Stellar Blast.\n\nShadowy Claws: Melee Weapon Attack: +8 to hit, reach 10 ft., one target. Hit: 12 (2d6 + 4) slashing damage plus 10 (3d6) necrotic damage.\n\nStellar Blast: Ranged Spell Attack: +6 to hit, range 120 ft., one target. Hit: 24 (6d6 + 3) force damage. On a failed Constitution saving throw (DC 16), the target takes an additional 14 (4d6) necrotic damage and is stunned until the end of its next turn.\n\nLegendary Actions:\n\nThe Astral Shadowstalker can take 3 legendary actions, choosing from the options below. It can use only one legendary action at a time and only at the end of another creature's turn. The Astral Shadowstalker regains spent legendary actions at the start of its turn.\n\nShadow Step: The Astral Shadowstalker teleports up to 30 feet to an unoccupied space it can see.\nDarkened Aura (Costs 2 Actions): The Astral Shadowstalker releases a wave of dark energy in a 20-foot radius centered on itself. Creatures in the area must make a DC 16 Wisdom saving throw or be blinded until the end of their next turn.\nShadow Burst (Costs 3 Actions): The Astral Shadowstalker releases a burst of shadowy energy in a 30-foot cone. Each creature in the area must make a DC 16 Dexterity saving throw, taking 24 (7d6) necrotic damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.	96	2023-06-04 17:09:24.103686+00	30	\N	\N	2	\N
