90	90	I'm resourceful and can make the best out of any situation.	Nature: All things which live must one day die	I once spared a monster which went on to kill hundreds. I’ll never outlive the regret.	I obsess over my hunts to the point of neglecting my own health and well-being.	I was cursed with Lycantrhopy from youth and was shipped off to the Abby on Silean where Sasha took me in as her own. We quickly bonded over things of Ektu as not many have traveled from an Empirical land to a Republic land, though unsure why as I have not found the Republic as repulsive as the Empire made them out to be. \n\nI grew weary of something going on with Sasha as she began to act odd, distanced herself from me. She became obsessive with books and history, she would mutter about things that I had only heard about from my forefathers about before the new gods existed. She attempted to bring me into her obsession but something didn't feel right. She did not appreciate my concern and challenged me, I had a chance to end it, but I didn't, I couldn't. She taught me everything I had known. She was the family I needed, I wanted, until that fateful night. I was out the hunt, attempting to find those that had lost their minds and flee'd from the Abby as was normal when the young ones attempt to master their Lycan forms. When I came back, everything was destroyed. I searched through wreckage for survivors, but failed. Rumors began to spread to the city below of what had happened at the Abby, something about travelers, a dragon, Sasha? And a Reaper of a god? If these rumors are true, she must pay for what she's done, if she doesn't I fear it may lead to a battle celestial degree.	40	5'7	250	Blue	Black/Grey	Brown	Hopes to help the Jemmanites introduce themselves and their culture to Aetherend. To stop hiding in their caves and believing everyone is out to get them as the old forefathers believe.	Monster hunter		----Monster Hunter's Intuition \nYour instincts are honed to detect and track dangerous creatures. When entering a new area, you can usually determine if there are significant threats nearby. You become aware of any aberration, dragon, fey, fiend, monstrosity, ooze, or undead. or You can often find signs of monstrous activity, such as tracks, territorial markings, or rumors among locals. This ability doesn't reveal the exact location or nature of the threat but alerts you to potential danger, allowing you and your companions to prepare accordingly.\n\n-----Monster Hunter's Mark\nYou bear a simple mark, such as a tattoo or brand which identifies you as a monster hunter. By revealing this mark you can always find simple lodging food amongst the common folk.	Anyone from the Abby of Silean or those that are friends to it
