960	Other	Strike of the Fire Giant	ou have absorbed primeval magic that gives you an echo of the might of giants. Once per turn, when you hit a target with a melee weapon attack or a ranged weapon attack using a thrown weapon, you can imbue the attack with an additional effect:\n\nFire Strike. The target takes an extra 1d10 fire damage.\n\nYou can use this feat a number of times equal to your proficiency bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a long rest.	128
